  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Once per long rest, choose any targets within Very Close range to perceive you as a nightmarish horror. The targets must succeed on a Reaction Roll (16) or become temporarily <em>Horrified</em>. While <em>Horrified</em>, they're <em>Vulnerable</em>. Steal a number of Fear from the GM equal to the number of targets that are <em>Horrified</em> (up to the number of Fear in the GM's pool). Roll a number of <strong>d6s</strong> equal to the number of stolen Fear and deal the total damage to each <em>Horrified</em> target. Discard the stolen Fear.</p>",
